# Trial by Water (outlands 133), 112's free-slot test (getFreeSlotsCount() == 0) on both sides: accepted by GM at fame
# level 1 (the fame is read only while available), the whisper held, a full inventory: option 1 is refused
# (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED Leviathan's Rod, not completed, the whisper kept), option 0 and option 7 likewise
# (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0). Options 5 (10000 gil) and 6 (the spell) need no slot: user ruling 2026-11-04 (kept Lua
# bugs), the test is `option ~= 5 and option ~= 6`, so with a full inventory each completes (the Lua's `or` always held
# and refused them too, ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0). Between them and before the last arm a GM's delQuest and addQuest
# and the whisper again. With one free slot (the bag grown by one; the test is == 0): option 1 completes.
char zone=Norg pos=-13.0,1.1,-19.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWater accepted
keyitem WhisperOfTides
login
fill-inventory
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # accepted, the whisper: 112
finish option=1                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (Leviathan's Rod)
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # 112
finish option=0                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # 112
finish option=7                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # 112
finish option=5                           # 10000 gil (no slot needed); the title, the whisper taken; completed
quest Outlands.TrialByWater available     # a GM: delQuest
quest Outlands.TrialByWater accepted      # a GM: addQuest
keyitem WhisperOfTides                    # a GM
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # 112
finish option=6                           # the spell (no slot needed); completed
quest Outlands.TrialByWater available     # a GM: delQuest
quest Outlands.TrialByWater accepted      # a GM: addQuest
keyitem WhisperOfTides                    # a GM
storage inventory 31                      # one free slot (the bag one larger): the test is == 0, so it gives
trigger Edal-Tahdal                       # 112
finish option=1                           # Leviathan's Rod; completed
